<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="ro"><%- include("../fragmente/head", { titlu: "PC Forge - Top favorite" }) %><body id="top"><%- include("../fragmente/header") %><main class="main-cont"><section class="cont-card cont-card--lat"><span class="badge text-bg-danger">Administrator · Bonus 13</span><h2>Top produse favorite</h2><div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-striped table-hover align-middle"><thead><tr><th>Produs</th><th>Favorite</th><th>Stoc</th><th>Reumplere</th></tr></thead><tbody><% produse.forEach(function(produs) { %><tr><td><a href="/produs/<%= produs.id %>"><%= produs.nume %></a></td><td><%= produs.numar_favorite %></td><td><%= produs.stoc %></td><td><form class="d-flex gap-2" method="post" action="/top-favorite/<%= produs.id %>/stoc"><input class="form-control" type="number" name="cantitate" min="1" step="1" required /><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Reumplere stoc</button></form></td></tr><% }); %></tbody></table></div></section></main><%- include("../fragmente/footer") %></body></html>
